<title>CANADA: Goodale to announce CWB barley monopoly results.</title>
<headline>Goodale to announce CWB barley monopoly results.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian Agriculture Minister Ralph Goodale plans to announce the results of a referendum on whether the Canadian Wheat Board should retain its monopoly on barley exports on Tuesday.</p>
<p>A news conference will be held in Winnipeg on March 25 at 1015 CST/1615 GMT, an Agriculture Canada statement said Friday.</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548))</p>
</text>
